[{:db/id "q-350040/field-1/07791849728418b50d59d705e3d959e93383e408886fd319ae3a513a1b7159ba" :answer/id #uuid "07bee4df-34be-523b-a39e-11cc153b9414" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{9}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-350040/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "aba5ed5f-33c8-5bac-80a9-0a1d10b1c047" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-350040/field-1/07791849728418b50d59d705e3d959e93383e408886fd319ae3a513a1b7159ba" :answer-field/choices ["q-350040/field-1/07791849728418b50d59d705e3d959e93383e408886fd319ae3a513a1b7159ba"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-350040" :question/id #uuid "51d3460d-2b85-5df6-aaeb-f815320dd08f" :question/math-academy-id "q-350040" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}9\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\\,\\text{d}x=$\n\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "If we let $u=2x,$ then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=2\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $\\pi /4$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $\\pi /2$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}9\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}9\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{9}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡u{|}_{0}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =-\\frac{9}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0)) \\\\  & =-\\frac{9}{2}(0-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-350040/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "746d1bc6-98ec-59a1-bec6-9dcfb7081a5d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-350040"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-10061/selection/6be3ab994bbfb3be448ec952866bafa2eaa0c047dc85658ccf9794cf8725342e" :answer/id #uuid "73adea33-79eb-5a4c-978f-1f0d9d8d0b21" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10061/selection/565969c0b1ae0e867f049dcc224d4a52e2fcadc76b459d69a6fe9cbac5ec8467" :answer/id #uuid "97a274ee-df90-514d-983e-ce1e20e74a36" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10061/selection/74fe676e59154d0e6991d8f058369a86502f88233edbeb7873df63d91a398b9a" :answer/id #uuid "573baa4f-503b-5dd9-93d2-9c54feaf5a51" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10061/selection/cc690aa9e6dc1383a7e8860941874b72faced3b9c1eb964dcd54c5f1c99e72e6" :answer/id #uuid "ec8e7c52-5b06-5b28-88b0-e9a26890dc4a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10061/selection/50fdd075349009f53c2a4c3451e9410e92c09baecb582fbfb78353f685b6dc13" :answer/id #uuid "f75c2c5c-2d41-50a8-a3ce-32c58cb27eb0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10061/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "b9a50451-6e29-5ecd-b9bd-77d581f6c3fb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-10061/selection/6be3ab994bbfb3be448ec952866bafa2eaa0c047dc85658ccf9794cf8725342e" :answer-field/choices ["q-10061/selection/6be3ab994bbfb3be448ec952866bafa2eaa0c047dc85658ccf9794cf8725342e" "q-10061/selection/565969c0b1ae0e867f049dcc224d4a52e2fcadc76b459d69a6fe9cbac5ec8467" "q-10061/selection/74fe676e59154d0e6991d8f058369a86502f88233edbeb7873df63d91a398b9a" "q-10061/selection/cc690aa9e6dc1383a7e8860941874b72faced3b9c1eb964dcd54c5f1c99e72e6" "q-10061/selection/50fdd075349009f53c2a4c3451e9410e92c09baecb582fbfb78353f685b6dc13"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-10061" :question/id #uuid "a813812e-454b-50d8-be77-8c4858095748" :question/math-academy-id "q-10061" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "If we let $u=2x,$ then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=2\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-10061/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "746d1bc6-98ec-59a1-bec6-9dcfb7081a5d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-10061"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-13647"] :question/problem "${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /8}5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "If we let $u=4x,$ then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=4\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $\\pi /8$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $\\pi /2$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /8}5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}5\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{4}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{5}{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡u{|}_{0}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =-\\frac{5}{4}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0)) \\\\  & =-\\frac{5}{4}(0-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{4}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-10064/selection/686df870555944d4ae1d1ac1bfeff328289e21c32a7579823d0e136417cea5c6" :answer/id #uuid "7b29baad-fae9-5bf7-9ecb-c5a11904dc5b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{9}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3-9x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10064/selection/183716a18c227f45d3d78217ac0707b2c4aba59b9ac735f4a14dc2db52d96a0a" :answer/id #uuid "58c81bd8-a57e-58a7-a1f9-336999dda162" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{9}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3-9x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10064/selection/872c6faf0e86d37bafbfb5fe38f49b1a14161207d8b4bb6cdd086683e7a19af6" :answer/id #uuid "0dc52ccc-210a-5f65-8015-e291b4047f29" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3-9x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10064/selection/a480150865e87b0c1b0dd2ad64cdc3d097c398030dbdb663a40e44cde9dd3beb" :answer/id #uuid "9823d868-e47d-503d-b39c-6adbc453e2e8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{9}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3-9x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10064/selection/7a490499690e8befb0d97d9b3e50dde14f1f319dfa04833205ee1c8ba984bdf4" :answer/id #uuid "baf9df36-02ca-5552-8e3a-3fc3cfdabceb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{9}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3-9x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10064/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "592e2b80-5326-5eec-ad94-43ea28783141" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-10064/selection/686df870555944d4ae1d1ac1bfeff328289e21c32a7579823d0e136417cea5c6" :answer-field/choices ["q-10064/selection/686df870555944d4ae1d1ac1bfeff328289e21c32a7579823d0e136417cea5c6" "q-10064/selection/183716a18c227f45d3d78217ac0707b2c4aba59b9ac735f4a14dc2db52d96a0a" "q-10064/selection/872c6faf0e86d37bafbfb5fe38f49b1a14161207d8b4bb6cdd086683e7a19af6" "q-10064/selection/a480150865e87b0c1b0dd2ad64cdc3d097c398030dbdb663a40e44cde9dd3beb" "q-10064/selection/7a490499690e8befb0d97d9b3e50dde14f1f319dfa04833205ee1c8ba984bdf4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-10064" :question/id #uuid "1bf0cbc8-cc5a-5684-ae3b-ac70b169300f" :question/math-academy-id "q-10064" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(3-9x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "If we let $u=3-9x,$ then \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-9\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=-\\frac{1}{9}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(3-9x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{9}\\,\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{9}\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{9}\\operatorname{sin}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{9}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3-9x)+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-10064/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "746d1bc6-98ec-59a1-bec6-9dcfb7081a5d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-10064"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-346081/field-1/7e3c15f7dad2b525db05d2faa3744bb86265628c4291bcb914c4fe56bd42fbb8" :answer/id #uuid "926d444a-bcf1-5dea-a87c-e951d9274896" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4}{\\pi}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-346081/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "7307115c-d6ba-51e9-80ac-f9c77a274d53" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-346081/field-1/7e3c15f7dad2b525db05d2faa3744bb86265628c4291bcb914c4fe56bd42fbb8" :answer-field/choices ["q-346081/field-1/7e3c15f7dad2b525db05d2faa3744bb86265628c4291bcb914c4fe56bd42fbb8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-346081" :question/id #uuid "5ca6da82-5a4c-5661-86a3-30cf1b78acbb" :question/math-academy-id "q-346081" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi x}{4})\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "If we let $u=\\frac{\\pi x}{4},$ then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{\\pi }{4}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{4}{\\pi }\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $\\pi /2$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can rewrite the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi x}{4})\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\cdot \\frac{4}{\\pi }\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{\\pi }(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(0)) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{\\pi }(1-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{\\pi }\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-346081/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "746d1bc6-98ec-59a1-bec6-9dcfb7081a5d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-346081"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-2203/selection/961be1ead7e521d4e6fe6320baa54002e82fe349db5e0b04716fc4e4ccdf9494" :answer/id #uuid "b3d9db40-b947-50d4-8c1b-2b8ac7f2553b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{10}\\operatorname{sec}⁡(10x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-2203/selection/ce7fde7372b751c09386e3ea68193e267e4254a28c45e4bcf438950141308af6" :answer/id #uuid "cfb0223a-b019-51e1-bd32-9824d30787ce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{10}\\operatorname{csc}⁡(10x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-2203/selection/42957ef82f4d2891089f9e42fc599e3087f655a3cbf8910e779905303d3512bd" :answer/id #uuid "19b1582d-6a11-5ebc-9a20-24d157c6c90e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{10}\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-2203/selection/cfa9b3454bfe24d7f1242955ec1fa993fce91bd97595008324f6b865748ea9ff" :answer/id #uuid "8719983b-9c53-50ee-aa68-107da10cefa4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10\\operatorname{sec}⁡(10x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-2203/selection/12131fdabcadf4babfd55291b0c18f005e23c10d72c18bb398d005e13aaa0306" :answer/id #uuid "554c1ddc-8f0e-5724-9154-efe619296a61" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{sec}^{2}⁡(10x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-2203/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "4400dc90-bde0-5101-9561-5c6e59a6889c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-2203/selection/961be1ead7e521d4e6fe6320baa54002e82fe349db5e0b04716fc4e4ccdf9494" :answer-field/choices ["q-2203/selection/961be1ead7e521d4e6fe6320baa54002e82fe349db5e0b04716fc4e4ccdf9494" "q-2203/selection/ce7fde7372b751c09386e3ea68193e267e4254a28c45e4bcf438950141308af6" "q-2203/selection/42957ef82f4d2891089f9e42fc599e3087f655a3cbf8910e779905303d3512bd" "q-2203/selection/cfa9b3454bfe24d7f1242955ec1fa993fce91bd97595008324f6b865748ea9ff" "q-2203/selection/12131fdabcadf4babfd55291b0c18f005e23c10d72c18bb398d005e13aaa0306"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-2203" :question/id #uuid "1ad5d9b8-93ef-5a72-b41c-0d3a93c1add9" :question/math-academy-id "q-2203" :question/problem "$\\int \\operatorname{sec}⁡(10x)\\operatorname{tan}⁡(10x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "If we let $u=10x,$ then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=10\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{10}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{sec}⁡(10x)\\operatorname{tan}⁡(10x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\operatorname{sec}⁡u\\operatorname{tan}⁡u\\cdot \\frac{1}{10}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}\\int \\operatorname{sec}⁡u\\operatorname{tan}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}\\operatorname{sec}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}\\operatorname{sec}⁡(10x)+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-2203/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "084eb4cc-2f84-5288-90a6-be84066922b6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-2203"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-346368/field-1/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "e3d9aafa-3356-542e-84ee-5f0448d1be98" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-346368/field-1/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer/id #uuid "e8a37403-b885-5788-a56f-6bd95497d5f9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-346368/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "dfee3815-d1d6-58ab-8aaa-8e20d47ccf38" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-346368/field-1/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer-field/choices ["q-346368/field-1/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" "q-346368/field-1/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-346368" :question/id #uuid "db159c18-c8d3-5523-8b58-03253c49fe06" :question/math-academy-id "q-346368" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{2\\pi /3}^{2\\pi }\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{x}{4})\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{x}{4})\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "If we let $u=\\frac{x}{4},$ then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{4}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=4\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives\n\n| $x$ | $2\\pi /3$ | $2\\pi $ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $\\pi /6$ | $\\pi /2$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can rewrite the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{2\\pi /3}^{2\\pi }\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{x}{4})\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{x}{4})\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{csc}⁡(u)\\operatorname{cot}⁡(u)\\cdot 4\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{csc}⁡(u)\\operatorname{cot}⁡(u)\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =4(-\\operatorname{csc}⁡(u))\\,{|}_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =4(-\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})+\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})) \\\\  & =4(-1+2) \\\\  & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-346368/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "084eb4cc-2f84-5288-90a6-be84066922b6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-346368"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-113983/selection/d33c0a3d6fd4985cae9c9707883fda3f803a8a8647ce3702ee573b5836979189" :answer/id #uuid "7aca1100-0ff1-5c3e-989c-0dcc25aca616" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{tan}^{3}⁡x}{3}+\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113983/selection/c79f050659e7d18a9f7c57765fd8ef40e17c049ee96cc218f6ad4355d9a09c1d" :answer/id #uuid "5997e9f8-5261-55f2-816b-5c2e2dde8c94" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{sec}^{3}⁡x}{3}+\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113983/selection/fd9d16b16bd962255d20da9543a121255141b95d3e30b07cf61ab84446a8ee7e" :answer/id #uuid "2cb02272-c621-5441-b3d5-152ac85ad705" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{sec}^{3}⁡x}{3}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113983/selection/24b12943534c178407da737ad2d196625db29f8ce76d4973206eac7d27ecd1c7" :answer/id #uuid "77809e94-9874-5c38-b8c0-34ddd00d75f5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{tan}^{3}⁡x}{3}+\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113983/selection/c4db6d929e0ffe8d6fbb2a52980bcee4f533ddb868dd66ba5a6f5e34b